MAIN
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 WhileTest_ved_TestWhile
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 16
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 17 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 17
PRINT TEMP 4
END
WhileTest_ved_TestWhile [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 18 0
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 19 0
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 4
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 20 4
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 21
CJUMP TEMP 6 L2
MOVE TEMP 22 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 7
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 23 1
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 9
JUMP L1
L2  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 25 0
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 25

RETURN TEMP 10
END

